# @nuxt/content adds `@nuxtjs/mdc > <subdep>` entries to vite.optimizeDeps.include.
# That syntax needs @nuxtjs/mdc resolvable from the project root, but pnpm only
# symlinks direct dependencies there, so all ten entries fail to resolve (NUXT_B7002).
# Hoisting mdc fixes the resolution without declaring a direct dependency on it —
# which would risk pinning a different version than @nuxt/content actually resolves.
public-hoist-pattern[]=@nuxtjs/mdc
